license: MIT
abstract: "A local-first desktop interface for locally managed language models and repository-grounded exploration of scientific dynamical-model repositories. Ask the Model v0.3.0 adds validated immutable EWD/CBD/RMD snapshots, deterministic local retrieval, per-chat model/repository pinning, compact citations and inspectable exact-SHA provenance while preserving ordinary local chat."
keywords:
  - local AI
  - local-first
  - large language models
  - Ollama
  - retrieval
  - provenance
  - scientific models
  - dynamical models
  - natural-language interface
  - research software
